    <rdfs:label>GPe MEIS2-SOX6 GABA</rdfs:label>
    <CAS:cell_ontology_term>arkypallidal neuron</CAS:cell_ontology_term>
    <CAS:rationale>Mapping to the arkypallidal neuron is based on location (GPe), expression of GAD1/2, FOXP2, MEIS2, and NPAS1 and lack of expression of canonical pallidal markers NKX2-1 and LHX6, SST and PV.</CAS:rationale>
